    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a dark, fog-filled graveyard, search for and hunt down ghosts.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 different weapons available: submachine gun, pistol, dagger, and grenade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon has its own characteristics \u2014 the dagger can only be used in close combat but deals very high damage, while the submachine gun and pistol allow for long-range attacks. Grenades can deal area damage to multiple targets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crouching makes it harder for ghosts to detect you, giving you the opportunity to launch a surprise attack first!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you run out of ammo, you\u2019ll need to find and collect supplies from random ammo drops scattered around the environment.</p></li></ul>",
